<title>UK: TABLE-Anglian Group yr pretax profit rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Anglian Group yr pretax profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 29, 1997.</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		  15.5		 vs   12.8</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	    5.4		 vs    4.5</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence)    9.0		 vs    7.5</p>
<p> Pretax			 20.2		 vs   16.2</p>
<p> Turnover		    223.3		 vs   194.3</p>
<p>NOTE - Anglian Group Plc, a home improvements company, said it had cash balances of 20.2 million pounds at the end of the year.</p>
<p>Full company name - Anglian Group Plc.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4366</p>
